Feature: Home Page Validation # features/home_page.feature:1
  As a user
  I want to verify that the home page elements are displayed correctly
  Scenario: Verify home page elements         # features/home_page.feature:5
    Given I am on the 99acres home page       # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:7
    Then the page title should be visible     # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:13
    And the Projects tab should be displayed  # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:18
    And the Search box should be displayed    # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:24
    And the Search button should be displayed # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:30

Feature: Property Details and Contact # features/property_details.feature:1
  As a user
  I want to view property details and contact the seller
  Scenario: View Number Flow                           # features/property_details.feature:5
    Given I have searched for a location               # features/steps/search_steps.py:38
    When I click on the third property result          # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:10
    And I switch to the new tab                        # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:17
    And I click 'OK GOT IT' if present                 # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:22
    And I click the 'View Number' button               # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:27
    Then the contact details popup should be displayed # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:32
    And I take a screenshot of the view number result  # features/steps/property_details_steps.py:37

Feature: Property Search and Filters # features/search_and_filters.feature:1
  As a user
  I want to search for properties and apply filters
  Scenario: Location Search Flow                     # features/search_and_filters.feature:5
    Given I am on the 99acres home page              # features/steps/home_page_steps.py:7
    When I click on the Projects tab                 # features/steps/search_steps.py:9
    And I enter the location from test data          # features/steps/search_steps.py:16
    And I select the location from suggestions       # features/steps/search_steps.py:22
    And I click the Search button                    # features/steps/search_steps.py:27
    Then the search results page should be displayed # features/steps/search_steps.py:32

  Scenario: Property Search Filter Refinement         # features/search_and_filters.feature:13
    Given I have searched for a location              # features/steps/search_steps.py:38
    When I apply the 3 BHK filter                     # features/steps/search_steps.py:49
    And I apply the 2036 filter                       # features/steps/search_steps.py:49
    Then the required property card should be visible # features/steps/search_steps.py:60

